Link to try the app (no download required): 
https://science-bowl-trainer.onrender.com/ 

Features:
- Solo mode
- Contest (multiplayer) mode
- Custom topic selection
- Tossup/Bonus only selection
- AI only/Exact PDF/AI + PDF question selection
- Timed/Untimed mode
- Yes/no penalties
- Light/dark mode
- Read aloud questions
- Type/speak out answers
- Upload custom question packets
- Study bank
- Difficulty selection
- Session review